PortSystem          1.0
PortGroup           golang 1.0

go.setup            github.com/UniRate-API/unirate-cli 0.1.0 v
revision            0

description         Command-line currency converter and exchange-rate tool

long_description    {*}${description} powered by the UniRate currency API. \
                    unirate converts amounts between currencies, prints live \
                    exchange rates, lists supported currencies and looks up \
                    EU VAT rates, straight from the terminal. The API key is \
                    read from the UNIRATE_API_KEY environment variable.

categories          net
installs_libs       no
